# Generated SVGs are the product, and verification depends on byte-identity
# between a local run and the Linux Action. Everything text is LF in the repo
# AND in the working tree, so `generate_profile.py` output diffs cleanly.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary